# CITATION.cff — fill in author details after deanonymization
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or data, please cite the paper as below."
type: software
title: "Beyond Similarity: LLM-Based Generation of Typed Semantic Links for Ontology Networks"
abstract: >
  An end-to-end pipeline combining domain-adapted DistilBERT embeddings,
  clustering-based pre-filtering, and GPT-4o-driven relationship generation
  to discover and generate typed, justified semantic links for ontology network
  development. Applied to ReproduceMeON (33 ontologies, four domains).
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-05-11"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - ontology network
  - knowledge interoperability
  - large language models
  - ontology alignment
  - scientific reproducibility
  - DistilBERT
  - GPT-4o
